WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.539 --> 01:46.990
=Episode 20=

01:51.820 --> 01:52.850
Qi.

02:02.800 --> 02:04.300
I hope you'll stay with me

02:05.650 --> 02:06.890
forever.

02:08.370 --> 02:10.990
Jinzhao, I will stay with you forever.

03:26.079 --> 03:29.680
Xuwei, am I not a joke,
not giving up despite knowing

03:30.790 --> 03:31.880
how it might end?

03:37.790 --> 03:41.079
Before, you were going to interrupt
the Resonance Spell between me and Qi.

03:42.960 --> 03:44.280
but you didn't.

03:46.190 --> 03:50.230
Thank you for letting me
indulge once more.

03:51.800 --> 03:55.880
No need to thank me.
I just wanted you to see clearly.

03:57.470 --> 04:00.750
Yue Jinzhao is more skilled
in the Resonance Spell than you.

04:04.910 --> 04:08.390
Yeah, 13 years' effort
can't compare to three years' effort.

04:09.640 --> 04:10.800
He is extraordinarily gifted.

04:12.240 --> 04:15.110
I should be happy for him, shouldn't I?

04:24.390 --> 04:26.760
Xuwei, you can't drink alcohol
with your condition.

04:30.550 --> 04:32.280
Xuwei.

04:38.880 --> 04:42.880
I will do my best to keep you
in a stable condition.

04:45.360 --> 04:47.390
Organ decay is incurable.

04:51.080 --> 04:52.190
How much longer can I last?

04:57.960 --> 05:01.420
No more than a year.

05:06.480 --> 05:07.500
A year is enough.

05:08.360 --> 05:10.080
The Qiyuan Sect has been annihilated.

05:10.080 --> 05:14.320
Next, the Sea of Clear Skies
must be dealt with within a year.

05:39.680 --> 05:42.159
You seem to have
an exceptionally good appetite today.

05:44.360 --> 05:47.240
I don't know why,
but I've been unable to get full lately.

05:48.000 --> 05:49.320
You've never been full before either.

05:50.840 --> 05:53.120
Could it be that you expended
too much effort yesterday?

05:53.640 --> 05:54.730
That makes sense.

05:56.440 --> 05:57.720
But why did so many soul fish

05:58.240 --> 06:00.120
suddenly appear yesterday
at their headquarters?

06:02.920 --> 06:04.200
It must be related to Bian Luohuan.

06:05.920 --> 06:08.680
You really had a hard time.
Come on, eat a lot.

06:10.700 --> 06:11.720
Here.

06:12.280 --> 06:13.880
Thanks. You guys are so kind to me.

06:18.280 --> 06:20.880
Why do they want Miss Yue
to absorb so many Qiyuan Orbs?

06:22.480 --> 06:24.750
Once at the Fujin Hall,
and then again at their headquarters.

06:25.360 --> 06:27.320
Doesn't that mean
they already set you up twice?

06:28.600 --> 06:29.640
That's too much.

06:30.760 --> 06:35.120
But every time
after I absorbed some Qiyuan Orbs,

06:35.120 --> 06:38.360
I found me stronger, and...

06:43.020 --> 06:44.110
I can eat even more.

06:48.000 --> 06:49.520
Can't you spit it out at once?

06:57.640 --> 06:58.700
Mr. Zuo.

07:00.400 --> 07:01.450
Leader.

07:02.920 --> 07:05.840
I must apologize to you
for what happened today.

07:07.120 --> 07:08.170
It's alright.

07:09.720 --> 07:11.720
I wonder what brings you here.

07:11.720 --> 07:13.000
I have come for the Hengdao Sect.

07:13.760 --> 07:15.160
One of their disciples has confessed

07:15.800 --> 07:18.000
they distributed many Qiyuan Orbs
to their believers.

07:18.600 --> 07:21.080
The calamity
of the Qiyuan Orbs is far from over.

07:22.240 --> 07:25.480
The people can never have peace
unless the Hengdao Sect is dealt with.

07:25.480 --> 07:29.240
Yes, the urgent matter now
is to locate their whereabouts.

07:29.840 --> 07:33.880
I have come this time
to bury the hatchet

07:34.720 --> 07:37.200
and join hands with you against them.

07:38.360 --> 07:40.680
Mr. Zuo, don't worry.
We are still in pursuit.

07:41.240 --> 07:43.320
If we come across
any leads in the future,

07:43.320 --> 07:45.080
we will definitely share them with you.

07:45.720 --> 07:48.560
Thank you very much. I'll take my leave.

07:52.920 --> 07:53.960
I will see Mr. Zuo out.

07:56.620 --> 07:58.080
(Ruyi Inn)

07:58.080 --> 07:59.150
Mr. Zuo.

08:02.480 --> 08:03.500
Mr. Yue.

08:04.040 --> 08:06.800
Please select someone else
to inherit the Silver Shadow.

08:10.060 --> 08:12.400
Do you still remember
the extraordinary sight

08:12.400 --> 08:15.150
when I gave you the sword?

08:29.720 --> 08:32.000
In fact, it was the sword
that chose you.

08:38.640 --> 08:42.280
Having lived for decades,
I have never misjudged a person.

08:52.240 --> 08:53.290
Jinzhao.

08:57.960 --> 08:59.720
Mr. Zuo still lets you keep the sword.

08:59.720 --> 09:00.750
Yes.

09:03.600 --> 09:06.030
Since it's been given to you,
you must perform well.

09:06.030 --> 09:09.160
Cheer up and do not let us down.

09:10.240 --> 09:11.800
Yes, boss.

09:14.040 --> 09:16.720
Qi, there is something
I have to tell you.

09:20.440 --> 09:22.600
I witnessed it with my own eyes
at their headquarters.

09:22.600 --> 09:24.160
Bian Luohuan could cast Mindlink on you.

09:33.320 --> 09:36.000
(Bian Luohuan can resonate with Qi?)

09:39.720 --> 09:41.760
And even the runes were the same.

09:45.040 --> 09:48.120
Considering this, if the Hengdao Sect
has close ties with us,

09:49.080 --> 09:51.800
I bet they have connections
with the Sea of Clear Skies too.

09:54.160 --> 09:56.330
Jinzhao, once Mr. Gu recovers,

09:56.330 --> 09:58.320
we'll go to the Sea of Clear Skies
to make it clear.

10:00.280 --> 10:01.320
Alright.

10:13.840 --> 10:17.400
Don't you want to spend
your last moments with Xiu?

10:19.440 --> 10:21.760
Do you think she doesn't know

10:22.360 --> 10:23.920
that I extended your life
for half a day?

10:25.360 --> 10:26.880
I've been protecting countless lives,

10:27.960 --> 10:29.680
but I only fear she'd die.

10:31.680 --> 10:32.800
She is so stubborn.

10:34.040 --> 10:36.360
I'm afraid she might
do something stupid.

10:38.880 --> 10:39.950
I will be taking care of her.

10:41.800 --> 10:42.920
I care about her too.

10:43.960 --> 10:47.800
From now on, I entrust her to you.

10:56.560 --> 11:01.000
Xian Qing,
you've helped me a lot these years.

11:02.520 --> 11:05.280
Thank you. Take good care of yourself.

11:07.280 --> 11:09.880
The world is large.

11:09.880 --> 11:13.160
It's rare to meet someone you like.
Don't miss her out.

11:17.040 --> 11:18.060
Nagging.

11:24.000 --> 11:25.040
Let's go find Xiu.

11:26.480 --> 11:27.800
She didn't come with you.

11:28.920 --> 11:32.480
She must be hiding somewhere again,
feeling down alone.

11:41.400 --> 11:42.440
Follow me.

11:52.880 --> 11:54.720
(Kid, don't cry.)

11:56.880 --> 11:59.000
I'm not crying.

12:00.440 --> 12:02.560
Missy, where is your home?

12:03.360 --> 12:04.400
Why are you here alone?

12:05.920 --> 12:08.000
I am from the village
at the foot of the mountain.

12:08.800 --> 12:11.320
The village chief sent me here.

12:12.680 --> 12:15.280
He sent me to be the bride
of the Mountain God.

12:15.920 --> 12:17.280
The Mountain God's bride?

12:18.120 --> 12:23.200
The Mountain God
is the most powerful in the world.

12:25.000 --> 12:29.120
It wants a lot of things
to eat and many brides.

12:30.120 --> 12:33.360
Without food and a bride,

12:33.360 --> 12:36.320
it will go down
the mountain to eat people.

12:39.800 --> 12:43.840
Offering children to a demon
in exchange for the village's peace?

12:47.000 --> 12:48.010
How pathetic.

12:48.720 --> 12:51.240
I don't want
to be the Mountain God's bride.

12:51.760 --> 12:53.680
Neither does my mother want this.

12:56.600 --> 12:59.480
Little girl, let me take you home, okay?

13:01.600 --> 13:02.670
Come.

13:15.480 --> 13:16.720
I finally found you, Xiu.

13:47.760 --> 13:52.360
I haven't had a good talk
with you for a long time.

13:58.320 --> 13:59.520
When I adopted you,

14:00.720 --> 14:02.320
you would often hide away and cry.

14:03.120 --> 14:04.640
I always had to look for you.

14:05.800 --> 14:06.890
Don't do this anymore.

14:08.280 --> 14:10.720
When you are unhappy,
talk to your friends.

14:11.320 --> 14:13.640
At least, Xian Qing would be around.

14:20.440 --> 14:21.800
I don't need anyone else.

14:24.640 --> 14:28.440
Master, I only want you.

14:29.320 --> 14:30.410
I don't want anyone else.

14:38.510 --> 14:40.240
Silly, I will definitely die before you.

14:41.770 --> 14:44.960
Do you think I can live
as long as Xian Qing, that demon?

14:47.880 --> 14:48.940
No.

14:54.560 --> 14:58.560
In the cycle of life and death,
death gives way to life.

14:59.640 --> 15:04.080
Without death, how can life be precious?

15:17.200 --> 15:19.160
The key rings only recognize one owner.

15:20.280 --> 15:23.080
Unless their owners
willingly hand them over or pass away,

15:24.000 --> 15:25.440
they will not swap owners.

15:27.880 --> 15:31.680
From now on, I entrust Xian Qing
with the role of guardian.

15:37.040 --> 15:40.160
Master, let me succeed you.

15:43.120 --> 15:44.240
Xiu.

15:45.280 --> 15:47.840
It is your key ring.
I won't give it to anyone else.

15:53.200 --> 15:57.400
Xiu, the guardian position
is no child's play.

15:59.520 --> 16:02.240
I only hate seeing the future
and being unable to change it.

16:02.240 --> 16:04.680
It's not that I think
your guardianship is meaningless.

16:08.320 --> 16:12.560
Xiu, you once asked me
why I came to Jing'an.

16:14.920 --> 16:20.240
In Pureness, I saw the Zhengwu Alliance
would suffer heavy casualties before.

16:22.680 --> 16:26.160
But this time,
they have won a great victory.

16:29.360 --> 16:30.760
Didn't I always tell you

16:31.680 --> 16:34.560
that the future is not unchangeable?

17:03.120 --> 17:05.400
With the chance to foresee the future,

17:05.400 --> 17:08.079
guide it towards the path you hope for

17:09.280 --> 17:10.680
to protect those you want to protect.

17:12.599 --> 17:17.640
I believe that being the guardian
of Pureness is a fortunate thing.

17:20.720 --> 17:24.119
Just sacrificing one's own happiness
for that of others.

17:25.480 --> 17:26.480
How is that fortunate?

17:41.000 --> 17:44.840
Silly, you'll understand in the future.

17:47.880 --> 17:51.760
But at this moment, I somewhat hope

17:52.480 --> 17:54.400
that you'll never have to understand.

18:00.640 --> 18:03.280
Do you still remember
the day we first met?

18:05.360 --> 18:06.960
You were crying so sadly.

18:09.920 --> 18:11.440
It made my heart ache.

18:14.640 --> 18:20.920
Thinking that I wouldn't
let you feel that sad again.

18:36.160 --> 18:40.200
Xiu, I'm sorry.

18:42.200 --> 18:49.040
I broke my promise.

19:12.340 --> 19:14.190
♪The sorrowful wind♪

19:14.190 --> 19:16.170
♪And the falling snow♪

19:16.750 --> 19:21.610
♪Can't bear to see your tears♪

19:23.600 --> 19:27.210
♪I can't be without you♪

19:29.640 --> 19:30.730
Master.

19:33.580 --> 19:38.410
♪Like a flower's reflection in a mirror♪

19:39.340 --> 19:44.240
♪Like hidden feelings
as sharp as icicles♪

19:45.840 --> 19:47.820
♪With the lightest whisper♪

19:47.820 --> 19:50.250
♪You make the harshest decision♪

19:50.250 --> 19:56.650
♪It's not different
from the extreme penalty♪

19:59.720 --> 20:03.760
♪If you really have the heart
to leave me alone♪

20:05.230 --> 20:10.960
♪Why do I see tears
shimmering in your eyes♪

20:10.960 --> 20:16.040
♪What I thought would be evergreen
withers between my fingers♪

20:16.040 --> 20:21.260
♪Even our hug feels unnatural♪

20:22.090 --> 20:26.510
♪If it's all fate♪

20:31.400 --> 20:34.680
(Master, this time,)

20:36.920 --> 20:38.480
(you won't push me away anymore.)

20:39.920 --> 20:44.460
♪Singing my yearning♪

20:47.060 --> 20:51.690
♪In the dream♪

20:53.840 --> 20:58.730
♪Singing my yearning♪

21:04.160 --> 21:05.880
It's my fault.

21:07.680 --> 21:09.520
It's all my fault.

21:12.880 --> 21:16.680
So it turns out
Mr. Gu was revived temporarily

21:19.080 --> 21:20.320
through Xian Qing's demonic orb.

21:24.920 --> 21:26.480
My fault.

21:28.000 --> 21:29.560
My fault.

21:31.920 --> 21:33.920
It's all my fault.

21:57.800 --> 21:58.860
Xian Qing.

22:02.440 --> 22:03.530
I'm going out for a walk.

22:27.320 --> 22:28.330
Ming Xiu.

22:46.640 --> 22:48.270
(Each of the Nine Springs
has its own power.)

22:49.040 --> 22:50.880
(Maybe there's a way
to bring the dead back to life.)

23:29.240 --> 23:32.880
The person is gone.
Do not grieve too much.

23:37.760 --> 23:39.320
The person is gone.

23:41.880 --> 23:46.600
No one will invite me
to play chess together anymore.

24:03.840 --> 24:07.880
Zhaoyan, do you know?

24:10.320 --> 24:11.400
Over these thousands of years,

24:14.080 --> 24:15.560
I have been watching
others' joy and sorrow

24:18.880 --> 24:20.960
from afar.

24:25.040 --> 24:26.480
After keeping to myself for so long,

24:29.440 --> 24:31.000
even making a few good friends

24:32.800 --> 24:34.480
feels like a stroke of good fortune.

24:54.520 --> 24:57.800
If you want to cry, then cry it out.

25:06.680 --> 25:08.080
Are you saying I want to cry?

25:14.320 --> 25:15.720
Over the years, I have...

25:25.160 --> 25:27.520
It's not good to be stubborn.

25:34.640 --> 25:35.840
That's what you told me.

25:39.760 --> 25:41.840
If the past me saw me now,

25:46.760 --> 25:48.600
I'd probably laugh at myself.

25:49.640 --> 25:50.640
Not at all.

25:54.400 --> 25:58.920
Your tears just now are not ridiculous.
They are very precious.

26:14.720 --> 26:17.840
Excuse me, what is needed
when a family passes away?

26:18.840 --> 26:21.080
A pair of white candles
to light the way ahead.

26:21.080 --> 26:23.160
A set of new clothes to brave the cold.

26:23.160 --> 26:25.760
A stack of paper money
to live a good life.

26:26.320 --> 26:27.400
We'll take them all.

26:27.400 --> 26:28.490
Alright.

26:30.080 --> 26:33.000
Do these things really work?

26:33.000 --> 26:36.800
Miss, these are the living's thoughts.

26:36.800 --> 26:37.840
Thoughts.

26:38.640 --> 26:40.840
We get married, raise children,
and make friends.

26:41.520 --> 26:44.920
Isn't it all to have someone
think of us after we die?

26:46.380 --> 26:50.680
Here, six coins in total.

26:51.480 --> 26:52.560
Alright.

26:56.240 --> 26:57.240
Okay, thank you.

27:03.400 --> 27:08.000
So this is how it feels
when someone passes away.

27:09.160 --> 27:12.160
It's like a cut in the heart.

27:14.000 --> 27:16.520
We care about Mr. Gu,
so we feel the pain.

27:19.440 --> 27:22.320
This is the "thoughts" that
the stall owner was talking about?

27:23.360 --> 27:24.400
Yes.

27:25.480 --> 27:28.000
Mr. Gu saved my life and taught me.

27:29.000 --> 27:31.120
To me, he was like
a teacher and a father.

27:32.560 --> 27:34.320
Before he died, he specifically told me

27:34.960 --> 27:36.480
our origins are still not clear,

27:37.240 --> 27:38.920
so we should never
let the guilt weigh us down.

27:40.590 --> 27:45.080
Jinzhao, we must not let him down.

27:48.480 --> 27:51.600
Qi, after we're done
with his funeral affairs,

27:52.880 --> 27:54.080
we head to the Sea of Clear Skies.

27:57.560 --> 27:58.570
Let's go.

28:06.200 --> 28:07.210
Ming Xiu.

28:09.070 --> 28:11.720
Ming Xiu?

28:11.720 --> 28:12.840
What's the matter?

28:12.840 --> 28:14.840
Ming Xiu and Mr. Gu's body
have both disappeared.

28:20.320 --> 28:21.840
She must've gone to Mount Yuqing.

28:22.680 --> 28:24.360
Then let's hurry and find her.

28:24.360 --> 28:27.120
Without the Yunlai Stone, it would
take at least a dozen days to get there.

28:29.400 --> 28:31.000
Shifang, do you have a way?

28:34.200 --> 28:36.320
Our alliance seized
a flying ship from the Qiyuan Sect.

28:36.320 --> 28:37.720
I will go get it.

28:37.720 --> 28:40.480
Okay, Qi, notify Xian Qing
and Zhaoyan. Let's go.

28:41.000 --> 28:42.060
Let's go.

28:57.780 --> 29:01.000
(Zhaoyan)

29:18.920 --> 29:22.640
Master, the Zhengwu Alliance
wiped out the Qiyuan Sect.

29:23.400 --> 29:26.600
And there seems a sect
behind the Qiyuan Sect called Hengdao.

29:27.240 --> 29:28.880
No one knows where it is.

29:32.400 --> 29:34.920
Zhaoyan has accomplished
another great feat.

29:36.480 --> 29:39.120
(Zhaoyan)
But she hasn't contacted me yet.

29:42.320 --> 29:44.720
Gu Hanjiang is gravely injured
and may not live longer.

29:46.600 --> 29:51.480
Zhaoyan must be heartbroken
for someone else again.

29:53.080 --> 29:54.700
Bian Luohuan is probably
from the Hengdao Sect,

29:55.160 --> 29:56.440
but the sect's location is unknown.

29:56.960 --> 29:58.000
What should we do next?

30:02.280 --> 30:03.840
We must push that person.

30:05.880 --> 30:07.360
Notify the businesses
in the Yinghui Fort

30:07.920 --> 30:11.520
to auction gemstones from Rehai
and create a bidding frenzy.

30:11.520 --> 30:12.520
Yes.

30:18.480 --> 30:20.120
When Rehai emerges,

30:21.720 --> 30:27.560
the interested will act
upon hearing the news.

30:42.960 --> 30:47.640
Your Lordship, Ying Xuwei annihilated
the Qiyuan Sect by his own hand.

30:48.760 --> 30:49.800
They've been annihilated?

30:50.960 --> 30:52.760
Then wouldn't there be
no supply of the Qiyuan Orbs?

30:54.640 --> 30:56.720
Are there any more clues about Rehai?

30:58.240 --> 30:59.560
Not yet.

30:59.560 --> 31:01.710
I have already dispatched more people,

31:01.710 --> 31:04.640
but there really isn't enough time.

31:07.040 --> 31:08.680
Ying Xuwei annihilated the Qiyuan Sect.

31:09.240 --> 31:11.600
That means he wouldn't supply us
with the Qiyuan Orbs.

31:12.520 --> 31:13.550
If that's the case,

31:15.120 --> 31:16.880
Rehai is our only hope.

31:24.960 --> 31:27.320
Dispatch more people
and search with all efforts.

31:28.320 --> 31:29.390
Yes.

31:37.280 --> 31:39.640
Your Lordship, if...

31:42.240 --> 31:43.600
If we can't find Rehai...

31:43.600 --> 31:44.640
We will definitely find it.

31:48.680 --> 31:49.770
We must find it.

32:08.200 --> 32:09.400
Miss Ming is not here.

32:09.960 --> 32:11.120
But Mr. Gu is here.

32:13.080 --> 32:14.640
They aren't together?

32:15.400 --> 32:16.880
She wouldn't do
anything stupid, would she?

32:23.400 --> 32:24.920
These are all records
about the Nine Springs.

32:28.160 --> 32:30.200
Is Miss Ming looking for something?

32:36.850 --> 32:38.090
(Entrance of Pureness)

32:43.280 --> 32:44.800
I have already succeeded
as the guardian.

32:45.880 --> 32:47.320
Why can't I enter the Dragon Pool?

32:51.240 --> 32:52.400
I will do it anyway.

33:26.880 --> 33:28.520
In the Nine Springs, energy gathers.

33:28.520 --> 33:29.920
In Pureness, one can foresee the future.

33:30.640 --> 33:34.400
(Shennong Nine Springs)
And the Dragon Pool...

33:35.960 --> 33:37.800
The Dragon Pool is located in Guixu.

33:37.800 --> 33:40.080
Legend has it
that it can bring back the dead.

33:40.720 --> 33:44.360
(Shennong Nine Springs)
Does Ming Xiu want to bring Mr. Gu back?

33:47.040 --> 33:48.360
The Nine Springs are interconnected.

33:49.840 --> 33:51.560
Xiu has just taken over
as the guardian of Pureness.

33:52.440 --> 33:53.480
The Yunlai Stone is back.

33:55.880 --> 33:56.940
Ming Xiu has returned.

34:10.080 --> 34:11.120
You went to Pureness?

34:19.159 --> 34:20.719
Miss Ming,
why put yourself through that?

34:21.960 --> 34:24.360
Miss Ming, it's no easy feat
to bring the dead back to life.

34:25.440 --> 34:28.800
It seems you can't enter
the Dragon Pool from Pureness.

34:32.239 --> 34:36.320
As long as there's a glimmer
of chance, I will try it.

34:38.560 --> 34:41.400
Ming Xiu, you can't even
enter Pureness now.

34:41.400 --> 34:42.760
How can you enter the Dragon Pool then?

34:43.760 --> 34:44.909
You just took over as guardian.

34:45.480 --> 34:46.880
You don't know much about what's inside.

34:46.880 --> 34:49.800
There's no need to say
these words of persuasion anymore.

34:52.000 --> 34:53.040
Xiu.

34:53.040 --> 34:55.159
Ming Xiu, we will join you.

34:55.159 --> 34:56.960
Together, we will surely find a way.

34:58.160 --> 34:59.160
Yes.

35:03.400 --> 35:06.120
Perhaps Maiming knows about it.

35:10.640 --> 35:13.720
In fact, Rehai is right
at our family's place,

35:17.200 --> 35:18.280
and Maiming is its guardian.

35:19.680 --> 35:21.920
Sorry for keeping it
from you all this time.

35:23.280 --> 35:26.000
But I think Maiming has been
a guardian for a longer time.

35:26.560 --> 35:28.720
Perhaps he knows more than we do.

35:29.840 --> 35:31.000
We can go to him for help.

35:32.120 --> 35:35.560
It's late, and Xiu
has suffered internal injuries.

35:37.000 --> 35:39.520
Let's sleep and set off tomorrow.

35:39.520 --> 35:42.360
Yes, Ming Xiu, have a good rest tonight.

35:42.360 --> 35:44.240
Tomorrow we will
accompany you to the Luo's.

36:10.760 --> 36:13.040
It's late. Why aren't you sleeping yet?

36:13.960 --> 36:15.520
I dreamt of the past.

36:20.960 --> 36:22.120
Do you still remember

36:23.160 --> 36:26.240
the hibiscus tree
that was here three years ago?

36:29.480 --> 36:33.760
Yes, that was
a well-grown hibiscus tree.

36:37.120 --> 36:40.240
I still remember
how you loved hibiscus most.

36:43.320 --> 36:46.240
(3 years ago, there was
a disturbance in the Spring Vein.)

36:47.560 --> 36:48.960
(Master took me to investigate.)

36:49.800 --> 36:52.400
(At that time, I had reached
the age for training,)

36:53.400 --> 36:55.960
(so he asked me to practice
on the demon beasts in the den there.)

36:57.920 --> 37:01.240
Master, I will go defeat
the demons in that den.

37:02.320 --> 37:04.360
When I come out,

37:05.960 --> 37:08.640
could you pin a hibiscus flower
in my hair for me?

37:14.560 --> 37:16.280
That's the deal, anyway.

37:23.440 --> 37:25.360
(But when I came out from the den...)

37:29.000 --> 37:31.400
Master,

37:32.480 --> 37:34.520
I have dealt with all the demons inside.

37:42.240 --> 37:45.680
Master, the flower I asked for...

37:49.000 --> 37:50.760
The flowers here bloom very well,

37:52.120 --> 37:53.400
so I couldn't bear to pluck them.

38:02.640 --> 38:06.120
I understand, Master.

38:13.440 --> 38:14.800
After returning from the Spring Vein,

38:17.000 --> 38:19.120
Master sat
under the hibiscus tree all night.

38:20.520 --> 38:22.320
When I woke up the next day,

38:24.960 --> 38:26.960
I found he had chopped down
the hibiscus tree.

38:29.320 --> 38:33.520
In its place, there was
this cloud pear tree.

38:36.720 --> 38:38.680
The pear signifies parting.

38:39.600 --> 38:41.480
Did something happen
when Hanjiang was alone

38:42.760 --> 38:44.040
outside the den?

38:47.880 --> 38:48.880
I don't know.

38:52.200 --> 38:53.520
But it was from that day on,

38:55.520 --> 39:00.240
many things seemed
to have changed imperceptibly.

39:38.080 --> 39:39.800
Our honored guests have arrived.

40:01.940 --> 40:04.850
♪Looking back♪

40:05.970 --> 40:09.170
♪I try to bring back memories♪

40:10.060 --> 40:13.970
♪We're connected♪

40:13.970 --> 40:16.240
♪It's meant to be♪

40:17.840 --> 40:21.490
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

40:22.000 --> 40:25.810
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

40:25.810 --> 40:28.050
♪On a moonlight night♪

40:28.050 --> 40:30.030
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

40:30.030 --> 40:32.750
♪About you♪

40:32.750 --> 40:36.050
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

40:36.750 --> 40:40.140
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

40:40.690 --> 40:42.540
♪The past glided before my mind♪

40:42.540 --> 40:44.780
♪I smiled and cried♪

40:44.780 --> 40:50.040
♪For happiness♪

40:50.040 --> 40:53.940
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

40:53.940 --> 40:58.030
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

40:58.030 --> 40:59.980
♪In this tranquil world♪

40:59.980 --> 41:02.030
♪I've finally found you♪

41:02.030 --> 41:06.060
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

41:06.060 --> 41:09.810
♪I've been looking for you♪

41:09.810 --> 41:13.940
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

41:14.770 --> 41:16.210
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

41:16.210 --> 41:18.480
♪I engrave your name♪

41:18.480 --> 41:24.500
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

41:40.020 --> 41:43.020
♪Wind rises and rain ceases♪

41:43.990 --> 41:47.150
♪During the long-lost quiet time♪

41:47.990 --> 41:51.920
♪Both of us get closer♪

41:51.920 --> 41:54.060
♪And watch the stars♪

41:55.830 --> 41:58.990
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

